sequenceDiagram
    participant Browser
    participant MedusaAPI as Medusa API
    participant AuthMod as Auth Module
    participant GithubSvc as GithubAuthService
    participant StateStore as State Store
    participant GitHub as GitHub OAuth API

    Note over Browser,GitHub: Step 1 — Initiate redirect
    Browser->>MedusaAPI: GET /auth/customer/github
    MedusaAPI->>AuthMod: authenticate(actor_type, "github", req)
    AuthMod->>GithubSvc: authenticate(req, authIdentityService)
    GithubSvc->>GithubSvc: crypto.randomBytes(32) → stateKey
    GithubSvc->>StateStore: setState(stateKey, { callback_url })
    StateStore-->>GithubSvc: stored
    GithubSvc->>GithubSvc: getRedirect(clientId, callbackUrl, stateKey)
    GithubSvc-->>AuthMod: { success: true, location: "https://github.com/login/oauth/authorize?..." }
    AuthMod-->>MedusaAPI: { location }
    MedusaAPI-->>Browser: 302 Redirect → GitHub

    Note over Browser,GitHub: User authenticates on GitHub
    Browser->>GitHub: Login + Authorize app
    GitHub-->>Browser: 302 Redirect → callbackUrl?code=xxx&state=stateKey

    Note over Browser,GitHub: Step 2 — Handle callback
    Browser->>MedusaAPI: GET /auth/customer/github/callback?code=xxx&state=stateKey
    MedusaAPI->>AuthMod: validateCallback(actor_type, "github", req)
    AuthMod->>GithubSvc: validateCallback(req, authIdentityService)
    GithubSvc->>StateStore: getState(stateKey)
    alt state missing or expired
        StateStore-->>GithubSvc: null
        GithubSvc-->>AuthMod: { success: false, error: "No state provided, or session expired" }
        AuthMod-->>MedusaAPI: 401
        MedusaAPI-->>Browser: error
    else state valid
        StateStore-->>GithubSvc: { callback_url }
        GithubSvc->>GitHub: POST /login/oauth/access_token?code&client_id&client_secret&redirect_uri
        GitHub-->>GithubSvc: { access_token, refresh_token, expires_in, ... }
        GithubSvc->>GitHub: GET /user (Authorization: Bearer access_token)
        GitHub-->>GithubSvc: { id, name, email, avatar_url, ... }
        GithubSvc->>GithubSvc: entity_id = user.id.toString()
        GithubSvc->>AuthMod: authIdentityService.update(entity_id, ...) or create(...)
        AuthMod-->>GithubSvc: authIdentity
        GithubSvc-->>AuthMod: { success: true, authIdentity }
        AuthMod->>AuthMod: sign JWT
        AuthMod-->>MedusaAPI: { token }
        MedusaAPI-->>Browser: { token }
    end
